00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.450
To access your Microsoft Office
programs, you would need to go

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.030
down to the start menu, which is
in the bottom left hand corner.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.660
If you click on the Windows icon,
that will bring up a list of programs

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.010
that are installed on your computer.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.320
Everything is installed alphabetically,
so as you scroll down, you will see

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:23.884
the programs that have been installed
such as Excel, PowerPoint and Word,

00:00:23.955 --> 00:00:26.325
which are the three programs that
you will use during this course.

00:00:27.134 --> 00:00:30.225
To access the program, you would
simply click on the Word icon, and then

00:00:30.225 --> 00:00:31.725
that would open up, Microsoft Word.

00:00:32.805 --> 00:00:35.325
To make it easier to access
your software without having

00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:36.525
to go through the start menu.

00:00:36.585 --> 00:00:37.995
You can right click on that.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.040
And then select the more
option and pin to task bar.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.130
This will then place the
icon on your task bar.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:47.460
So by clicking on that, that will
open the program directly without

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.960
having to go through the start menu.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:52.380
You can then do this for your
PowerPoint and your Excel, which will

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.640
just speed things up a little bit.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:58.830
If I click on the icon now that
will launch Word and take me to

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:00.180
the Good Morning welcome screen.

